# Gas Guzzler: Start your engines! (CR 702.179), "This creature enters tapped" (CR 614.1d), and "Max speed - {B}, Sacrifice
# another creature or Vehicle: Draw a card" (CR 702.178a): the ability exists only at speed 4. Bot1's speed is 1 when the
# Guzzler enters tapped on turn 1, and a Lightning Bolt on each of turns 1, 3 and 5 raises it to 2, 3, then 4 (CR 702.179d).
# On turn 3, at speed 3 with an untapped Mox Jet to pay and an Ornithopter to sacrifice, the ability is refused. On turn 5 at
# speed 4 it is offered: the Mox Ruby (a noncreature artifact) and the Guzzler itself ("another") are refused as the
# sacrifice, the Ornithopter is taken, {B} from Mox Jet pays exactly (the pool is empty) and a card is drawn.

